    {
      "id": "11B353C083C8CEE3",
      "title": "Flux Dust",
      "subtitle": "Power",
      "icon": {
        "id": "fluxnetworks:flux_dust"
      },
      "description": [
        "Make Flux Dust on your island: place Obsidian, leave one air block above it, then place a second Obsidian above that gap.",
        "Drop Redstone into the gap and left-click the upper Obsidian with an empty main hand. Each Redstone makes one Flux Dust, up to 512 per click. The upper Obsidian moves down into the gap; break and reposition it for another batch. The base is reusable.",
        "Native Bedrock and Flux Block setups still work. Fake players cannot activate the island method."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "1A8958F60F0ED0E9"
      ],
